                "text": "I\u2019ve heard from small business owners in my district who made it clear what will happen if these credits expire and premiums skyrocket.\n\nIn the face of the uncertainty and inflation caused by the Trump administration, they can\u2019t afford another blow.\n\nCancel the cuts. Lower the cost. Save health care.",
