                "text": "Health care premium notices are arriving this month, and many Sacramentans are finding out they\u2019ll soon be paying more for their coverage. \n\nI want to hear from you. Share your story or a photo of your notice so I can show Republicans the real impact their actions are having on Sacramento families.\n\nhttps://t.co/SGGSv8JEVj",
