                "text": "Florin Square is in the heart of South Sacramento\u2014home to vibrant Black-owned small businesses.\n\nBusinesses like theirs are already juggling rising costs and tight margins. If Republicans let the ACA\u2019s enhanced premium tax credits expire, premiums could double. \n\nThat\u2019s make or break for small business owners.\nThese entrepreneurs deserve a fair shot, not higher costs.",
