                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans have shut down the government rather than lower your health care costs.\n\nPeople across our community are already getting their health care rate notices and I want to hear from you.\n\nClick the link and share how rising premiums are impacting you and your family. Together, let\u2019s show my Republican colleagues exactly how their policies are hurting the American people.\n\nhttps://t.co/OO31pXX4fp",
