                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans chose to shut down the government rather than lower health care costs. They chose to use food as leverage and ignored court orders telling them to stop. \n\nNow they\u2019re jamming through a continuing resolution that does nothing to stop premiums from skyrocketing and millions of Americans from losing coverage.\n\nRepublicans created this health care crisis. Time and again, they\u2019ve shown they can\u2019t be trusted to put people over politics.\n\nThe fight for affordable, high-quality care isn\u2019t over. And I won\u2019t back down.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
